  "notes": [
    "Rule fieldAlias names are editorial aliases; map to existing R6 SECTION-CONTRACTS and CONDITIONAL-CONTENT-SCHEMA; do not create new production field names.",
    "All conditional texts are from the single owner historical test configuration; never display a matched subsection under partial mismatches.",
    "Paragraph-level overrides MUST be split or attached to separate scope before a live renderer may select them.",
    "Zero source license evidence is created by this contract; rights/editorial approval remains separate.",
    "Missing conditional paragraphs are not an invitation for a model to fill them freely."
  ],
